# Ponytail Gain

Display this scoreboard when invoked. One-shot: do NOT change mode or persist anything.

The figures are published benchmark medians (5 everyday tasks; three models: Haiku, Sonnet, Opus). They are measured, not computed from the current repo. Source: https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail

## Scoreboard

```
  ponytail gain                     benchmark median · 5 tasks · 3 models

